      <data key="d2">"A person initiating the task of moving the spatula"&lt;SEP&gt;The User is defined as an individual who interacts with the robotic system and the environment to perform tasks. This interaction facilitates the execution of various activities, although no additional details or contrasting information are provided in the descriptions.</data>
