    <node id="robotic arm">
      <data key="d0">robotic arm</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A mechanical device designed for manipulation tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is a blue metallic device designed for performing tasks, often in automation. It features white accents and has a grayish-brown end effector. This mechanical device is commonly utilized in various operations and is characterized by its blue and white coloration, as well as movable joints that enhance its functionality. The design incorporates a beige gripper, adding versatility to its capabilities for handling different tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;"blue and white, jointed structure"</data>
      <data key="d3">"grasp;"manipulate;"move;"navigate;attempt placement";extend";manipulate;manipulate";move;observe";pick up"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"upper right"</data>
      <data key="d7">The robotic arm is a blue and white jointed structure designed for manipulation in the kitchen task, though it faced difficulties placing the spatula in the receptacle.&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is a technological object designed for use in the kitchen, potentially assisting with various tasks. It is characterized by its blue color with white accents and is strategically positioned in the upper right corner of the countertop. While the arm has a flexible joint that suggests it can move and is described as active or in motion, there are also descriptions stating that it appears to be suspended above the tabletop and stationary, not actively interacting with any objects. This duality implies that the robotic arm may have the capacity for movement while also being capable of being in a dormant state. Overall, the robotic arm embodies a versatile tool intended to enhance efficiency in culinary activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The robotic arm is intended to perform tasks such as moving objects within the environment.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-c601eedff7367685c4571bf3fb4e6897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68cacdd6054d2c5a724c318f2293b37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6637aa6d62e3c0cd174638fdbde9bed1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5d1f841c3ffd95eea19b16e4235fab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81be1e6ebc963331233c20fadd377f38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a69ef864f2a1c112d521af354d75117b</data>
