    <node id="Countertop">
      <data key="d0">Countertop</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The countertop is a flat surface commonly found in kitchens, specifically designed for food preparation and the placement of various items. It serves as the central workspace in the kitchen environment, providing a smooth and functional area for cooking and other activities. The countertop is essential for preparing food and organizing items, making it a fundamental feature in any kitchen setup.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"Supports items;"can be used for placement of items;"support;"supports various objects";"used for food preparation;can be cleaned";holding items";place";prepare;provides a workspace for kitchen activities."</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The countertop is central in the image, serving as the base for various objects, including tools and ingredients. Its primary function is to provide a stable and accessible surface for preparation and organization in a kitchen or workspace.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Countertop is an essential element of the kitchen, serving as a central workspace where various items are placed for cooking and other activities. This flat surface, typically constructed from materials in dark gray or black, facilitates the organization of kitchen tools and the preparation of food. The Countertop allows for the placement and observation of objects, including fruits and cooking tools, which are commonly used during meal preparation. Its multifunctional role is highlighted as it not only provides a practical area for cooking but also acts as a display space for scattered kitchen-related items, underscoring its crucial position within the kitchen environment.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-90bf5638ee3a3fcde326f28275031d19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10ba8da3ef47ad6ee34b78a94deace59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d05904a07eecb7b1c5f14ea5377015d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8b3be8b062bd6f0259a3b5b87310e3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c20c800151aa200a235c20907fabd14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c0edb3fc3a6a463b9c0c513db029035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9295a03107166f9f5e1bcd702e0107d7</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
