      <data key="d2">"A formal request to complete a specific action or task"&lt;SEP&gt;"A request for performing a specific action or task"&lt;SEP&gt;A task_request is a formal request aimed at performing a specific action or task within a given environment. It denotes a request for a specific action to be completed, highlighting the intention to initiate a defined operation or activity. This type of request encapsulates the need for an action to be performed, ensuring clarity and direction in its purpose.</data>
