      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The task request encompasses several objectives aimed at facilitating specific actions within a designated area. Firstly, it indicates a goal to navigate to cabinet 5 for potential interaction. Additionally, the task requests include moving a screwdriver from a sofa to a receptacle on the left counter. Another aspect of the task involves transferring a spatula from the right counter to the receptacle on the left counter. However, it should be noted that the directive to move the spatula from the right counter to the left receptacle was intended but ultimately not fulfilled.&lt;SEP&gt;The task_request event is initiated to facilitate the movement of a spatula in the living area.&lt;SEP&gt;The task request involved moving the spatula from the right counter to the receptacle on the left counter.</data>
