    <node id="Kitchen">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The kitchen is a designated room in a house specifically designed for cooking and food preparation. It serves as a crucial area that facilitates various activities related to food, making it an integral part of daily household life. Equipped with a range of furnishings, appliances, and utensils, the kitchen not only supports the creation of meals but also plays a significant role in the cleaning and organization of food-related tasks. This multifunctional space enhances the culinary experience and is essential for any home, often being described as a room or area where food is prepared and cooked.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Contains items and equipment related to food preparation;"N/A";"used for cooking;entertaining";promotes culinary activities."</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen is an essential space within a home or establishment specifically designed for food preparation and cooking activities, serving as the primary environment where various culinary tasks are conducted. Characterized by its functional setup, the Kitchen is equipped with key elements such as a refrigerator, cabinetry, flooring, and numerous appliances, including stoves and countertops, all supporting its purpose. Central to the Kitchen’s design is the sink, strategically located in the middle area to facilitate its use. This space includes a left counter, which is an important area where the Agent interacts with various objects, particularly noting the left drawer near the sink that contains a diverse assortment of items. Overall, the Kitchen not only supports cooking and food preparation but also plays a significant role in daily life and interactions, underscoring its importance within domestic environments, including tasks such as moving the spatula.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-36c21ce0cac5376fb97197d20a05ec65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd1939605e599b2e8f3c53f763836e8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076095ba2122027b75302f3f5d2337c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10ba8da3ef47ad6ee34b78a94deace59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870ef109d81ab32053f9af21c1d0a708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-886662ca03584defff8748507c0de09f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62fd5bc5149a51dfc46863346c5e8c37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d05904a07eecb7b1c5f14ea5377015d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f21be762aa6dcf22e2e46bd7c66b1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fde43ad2483ca3cce0ed9d1fff41ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d178dad5c42c696b656b21ab2b6d2aee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ea0022d19a84caef9943d67d71da06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c20c800151aa200a235c20907fabd14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e4732c09360078976a5ca82ab6343d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ecda63622f4be34fc2a13f670bdb0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6b53c2b60c482c47280b9bfb98e486</data>
