    <node id="Kitchen Environment">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Environment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"A domestic workspace designed for food preparation and cooking."&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Environment refers to a designated space within a home or building specifically intended for the preparation and cooking of food. This area is designed for various cooking and food preparation activities and is equipped with a range of tools and appliances essential for these tasks. It serves as a general referent to the space where kitchen objects and culinary activities occur, creating an organized environment conducive to meal preparation and related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;"The overall setting that includes various tools and components used for cooking and food preparation."</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen Environment encompasses a wide range of elements and equipment used in the preparation and cooking of food. It includes various appliances, cabinetry, furniture, and flooring that together facilitate cooking and food storage. This environment is characterized by its functionality for culinary tasks and is filled with a variety of cooking utensils and tools. Additionally, it features objects such as fruits and other kitchen tools, creating an ideal setting for culinary activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Kitchen Environment is the setting where various tools and objects are utilized for culinary tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen environment encompasses all objects and tools used for culinary tasks, including utensils, appliances, and workspace.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-90bf5638ee3a3fcde326f28275031d19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df3ed2454d9a0ce69819c98cb60a8d0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9295a03107166f9f5e1bcd702e0107d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c0edb3fc3a6a463b9c0c513db029035&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b71b6fbeda10c5a938a71961c2150e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ecda63622f4be34fc2a13f670bdb0fa</data>
