      <data key="d2">"A series of actions aimed at achieving a specific task."&lt;SEP&gt;The Action Sequence refers to a structured series of steps or actions performed by an agent to accomplish a specific task. In the context of a kitchen, it entails a series of actions that the agent undertakes to carry out culinary activities effectively. Overall, the Action Sequence is integral to the systematic performance of tasks, ensuring that each action is purposefully organized to contribute to the successful completion of a goal.&lt;SEP&gt;"The series of actions taken to achieve a task"</data>
