    <node id="Table">
      <data key="d0">Table</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">A table is a piece of furniture characterized by a flat surface typically supported by one or more legs. It is utilized for various activities, such as placing items, eating, or providing a workspace. Tables can come in different shapes, including rectangular designs, and may feature various surface finishes, such as a dark polished finish. Overall, tables serve multiple purposes and are essential pieces of furniture in many settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used for placing objects;"N/A";"Place objects on it;"hold_objects;"place items;"supports_objects;dine;dining;interact with items on its surface.";provides_surface";serve_as_workspace";work;work";working"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"Requires a stable surface;"limited_by_space";may have weight limits"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The entity in focus is the Table. In the current context, the table is involved in an interaction where a robotic arm is engaging with objects placed on it. Other descriptions provided were marked as "N/A," indicating that there was no additional information available.</data>
      <data key="d6">"Center of the room; the robotic arm is extending over it."&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"Positioned in the living area where other objects are arranged around it."</data>
      <data key="d7">The Table is a central piece of furniture in the domestic interior environment, characterized by its rectangular shape and a dark, polished surface. Primarily constructed of wood, it serves multiple functions, including dining and working, making it a versatile addition to the room. Positioned centrally, the Table not only enhances the visual appeal of the space but also acts as a reference point for the arrangement of other objects. In addition to its main surface, the Table features two shelves underneath, further increasing its functionality. It is frequently utilized for interaction with various items, solidifying its role as a key focal point within the indoor room's features.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-0f25348c99f083f8776a2ff0e1e0f6d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4871e034512b0b2f656d2ac6e551a0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-233a9fb80fcfd753f9dbddc33ecca7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca8dbd42a1ba490605848abbde35a0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-689a0dcf20eb6228bd70e41f54283f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a5ed4a89b2aa0297099f4ccbb1618fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66d0dec0176e8cdb2ed0fb4fc21c1bca</data>
