    <node id="environment context">
      <data key="d0">environment context</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"The setting and conditions surrounding an event or action"&lt;SEP&gt;"the setting in which the task occurs"&lt;SEP&gt;The environment context refers to the setting or situation within which observations and tasks occur. It encompasses the surrounding conditions and spatial elements that influence the execution of actions. This context is crucial as it provides the relevant conditions specific to a task, shaping the way activities are performed and how observations are interpreted. Overall, the environment context serves as the backdrop for various interactions, affecting both the execution of tasks and the outcomes of observations.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The environment context describes the indoor kitchen-like setting with specific features like light wooden counters and a robotic arm.&lt;SEP&gt;The environment context encapsulates the overall conditions affecting the embodied agent's navigation and interactions. Specifically, it refers to a kitchen setting, which includes critical areas around the sink and countertop where various objects are observed. The environment comprises a room featuring a sofa, a wooden table, a robotic arm, and receptacles situated on the left counter. Additionally, the environment context includes both the right and left counters, which serve as surfaces pertinent to the tasks at hand.&lt;SEP&gt;The environment context refers to the kitchen setup where the interaction and the spatula placement task take place.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-37720e0e8670494d882077e0c2fdb0d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68cacdd6054d2c5a724c318f2293b37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eeb441be53fc268e39b960b325a5189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5d1f841c3ffd95eea19b16e4235fab4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81be1e6ebc963331233c20fadd377f38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec35a8ddafd6be77a53ae9f696da899c</data>
