    <node id="Red Apple">
      <data key="d0">Red Apple</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">Red Apple is a round, small to medium-sized fruit that is commonly consumed either fresh or used in cooking. It is characterized by its sweet and crisp texture, making it a popular choice for snacks. A typical red apple is often found stationary on the counter, emphasizing its role as a convenient and accessible food option.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"consume";"eat;slice;use as an ingredient";use in cooking"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The red apple is a small to medium-sized fruit that is currently resting on the kitchen countertop. It is positioned globally to the left of a robotic arm and is located in the top-left area of the table. The apple sits alone on the table surface, unobstructed by other items, and remains unattended, suggesting it may be intended for consumption.</data>
