    <node id="Black Spatula">
      <data key="d0">Black Spatula</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Black Spatula is a versatile cooking utensil primarily used for flipping or stirring food. It features a flat and wide shape, which allows it to effectively serve various culinary purposes. The spatula is designed with an angled orientation, where the handle points towards the bottom-right, enhancing its usability in the kitchen. Additionally, it is made from heat-resistant material, ensuring it can withstand high cooking temperatures while performing its tasks effectively. The Black Spatula is an essential tool for both home cooks and professional chefs alike.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"flip;serve;serve";stir;transfer"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"not_suitable_for_high_temperature_use_if_made_of_plastic;requires_cleaning"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"near the center-left of the image;positioned diagonally on the table"</data>
      <data key="d7">The black spatula is a kitchen tool designed for cooking and food preparation, specifically made to flip or serve food while exhibiting heat resistance. Positioned in the lower-center area of the countertop with its handle pointing towards the bottom-right corner, the spatula is angled in a way that suggests it is ready for use, although it is described as an unused utensil. This duality in its description indicates that while the spatula may not have been utilized yet, its placement and orientation imply that it is easily accessible for future cooking or serving tasks.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-fdc906fd17b2cd2dc03c0315b87b8508&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870ef109d81ab32053f9af21c1d0a708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1fde43ad2483ca3cce0ed9d1fff41ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1acaff11bbff5a86e31bcdd5bfb75840</data>
