    <node id="Task Goal">
      <data key="d0">Task Goal</data>
      <data key="d1">abstract_entity</data>
      <data key="d2">The Task Goal represents a specific objective that an agent aims to achieve, which involves retrieving a spatula from the right counter. This goal encapsulates the intention behind the agent's actions, clearly defining what needs to be accomplished in relation to the task.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"navigate;observe"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Task Goal involves several objectives centered around the proper handling and movement of kitchen utensils and navigation within a designated area. Primarily, the Task Goal is to identify the correct location from which to fetch a screwdriver. Additionally, it includes moving a spatula from the right counter to the left receptacle, which outlines a specific action intended to be completed. Another aspect of the Task Goal is to navigate to cabinet 7 while maintaining awareness of the surrounding environment. However, it is noted that the task goal was not fully achieved, as the spatula ultimately remained on the right counter instead of being relocated as intended.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-22ea0022d19a84caef9943d67d71da06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dab3b2ab25624ac7380dc7e69935118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b925f80758e59af0292fad540647ac31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36f3683717d923b16cff2cf4b6372c30</data>
