    </node>
    <node id="Receptacle">
      <data key="d0">Receptacle</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A container or space designated for holding something."&lt;SEP&gt;The term "Receptacle" refers to a container specifically designed to hold or store items. It is noted for its versatility in organizing and collecting various objects, making it an essential solution for storage needs. Often described as a container or space, a receptacle serves the practical purpose of managing and containing a range of items effectively. In particular, one example mentioned is a receptacle located on the left counter. Overall, receptacles are integral in providing a practical means for organization within various environments.&lt;SEP&gt;"A receptacle is a general category of containers designed to hold various items or substances."</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"hold;contain";store</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">A receptacle is a broad category that encompasses various types of containers, including sinks.&lt;SEP&gt;Receptacles are broad abstract entities that describe spaces or containers capable of holding other objects, commonly relevant in settings such as kitchens and bathrooms. In this particular context, the receptacle is specifically located on the left counter and is intended to receive the spatula as part of a cooking task. Its position is consistently noted across multiple descriptions, underscoring its functionality in facilitating the transfer of the spatula from the right counter to the receptacle on the left counter before the spatula is ultimately placed in the sink. Overall, the receptacle serves a significant role in the kitchen setup by organizing tools and ensuring an efficient workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;The receptacle is on the left counter and was intended to receive the spatula, but its exact condition and contents are unclear due to obstructions.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-36c21ce0cac5376fb97197d20a05ec65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88973b588d1feb7be9ea10c1a68d74ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a14dd52a4347d928d6c41c9c0ac0e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be286acead4ef1bc70824041a807170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b925f80758e59af0292fad540647ac31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafa3ce59a3a5cce1f123e2ae69b96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62fd5bc5149a51dfc46863346c5e8c37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-798eb7758d55600cec34d19901420b51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b639cd1c084b9a66144da184b9c32741</data>
