    <node id="Indoor Environment">
      <data key="d0">Indoor Environment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A space enclosed by walls, typically for living or activity"&lt;SEP&gt;The Indoor Environment is a contemporary setting that integrates technology and comfort, making it conducive for various human activities. This environment is typically characterized by a variety of furniture and objects that facilitate these activities. It is an enclosed space where a range of activities occurs, including the movement of objects. Overall, the Indoor Environment serves as a versatile backdrop for everyday life, designed to enhance both functionality and comfort.</data>
