      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Indoor Environment is a carefully designed room featuring a light wooden floor. It integrates various pieces of furniture and decorative elements, all arranged around a central table, creating a functional and aesthetically pleasing space. Within this environment, there are two counters; the right wooden counter is equipped with a spatula, while the left dark-colored counter holds a receptacle. Additionally, this indoor environment comprises multiple components that contribute to enhancing usability and comfort within the space. Overall, it serves as the defined setting where tasks, such as moving a strawberry, are carried out, incorporating diverse surfaces and objects that facilitate these activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The indoor environment likely serves multiple purposes, such as living, dining, and recreation, featuring various furniture and objects.</data>
