    <node id="Sofa">
      <data key="d0">Sofa</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The sofa is a versatile and comfortable piece of seating furniture designed to accommodate multiple people, primarily in living areas. It is characterized by a modern design and typically features cushioned seating, which enhances both comfort and style. A typical sofa includes three light gray cushions that function as a supportive backrest, contributing to its aesthetic appeal and inviting nature. Generally upholstered, sofas are suitable for various indoor living spaces, making them an essential element of home furnishings. They serve the dual purpose of providing practicality and comfort, making them ideal for relaxation and socializing. Overall, the sofa is a fundamental fixture in home decor, embodying both functional and stylish qualities.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"accommodate seating;"can be sat on;"provide_seating";"sit;lean;move";place;place items";place objects";provide comfort";provides comfort and relaxation";relax"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"should be kept away from fire sources;requires regular cleaning"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"Positioned against a wall painted in a muted pink shade; close to neighboring furniture and a potted plant."</data>
      <data key="d7">The sofa is a versatile piece of furniture located in the living area, designed to enhance comfort and functionality. It serves as a focal point for relaxation and social interaction, usually positioned against a wall or centrally within a room to facilitate a well-planned seating arrangement. In this specific setting, the sofa is placed behind a central table, contributing to both the aesthetic appeal and functionality of the space. A yellow cup, positioned slightly to the left of center on the sofa, adds a personal touch, suggesting an inviting atmosphere for those who gather there. Previously, there was an error in the records regarding the contents of the sofa, mistakenly suggesting it contained a screwdriver; this has been corrected. The gray sofa, in particular, is situated against the right wall and under a window, further indicating its role as a comfortable seating option in the living area, conducive to various activities and social engagements.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-fae1e4a0a20d9a09831a9b5d49619d65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4871e034512b0b2f656d2ac6e551a0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b6b2acc8305133b9f878445cdab5bbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f9b97c37b1f2246853727990c5b65df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-689a0dcf20eb6228bd70e41f54283f8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3766328c3cde2e0365b9ffc47d9f6bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f21be762aa6dcf22e2e46bd7c66b1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-798eb7758d55600cec34d19901420b51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d9ad9f9d9ea63530e30288fe9253a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597005f2046052883060cb8d0b574098</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
