    </node>
    <node id="Exercise Ball">
      <data key="d0">Exercise Ball</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A large gray ball used for physical exercises"&lt;SEP&gt;The Exercise Ball is a flexible, inflatable, and spherical fitness accessory primarily used for exercises and physical therapy. Designed to enhance physical exercise routines, it serves multiple purposes, including improving core strength, balance, and stability. Additionally, it provides decorative appeal in various settings. Its versatile design allows it to be effectively utilized in a wide range of workouts, making it an essential tool for both fitness enthusiasts and individuals undergoing rehabilitation. Overall, the Exercise Ball is a multifunctional device that contributes to physical fitness and therapeutic practices.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used for balance, strength training, or rehabilitation.";"N/A";"balance;"can be used for sitting;"promote fitness;"used for exercises;balance;balance training";core strengthening";decorative piece";exercise";exercising;stability training</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"limited by size;needs flat surface for optimal use"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">The Exercise Ball is positioned centrally on the gray carpet in the middle ground of the space, where it serves a dual purpose as both a fitness tool and a decorative element. Additionally, there is a note indicating another Exercise Ball located on the floor to the left. Overall, the descriptions highlight the ball's functional use in fitness contexts while also acknowledging its aesthetic appeal within the environment.</data>
      <data key="d7">The exercise ball is a large, gray spherical object primarily used for fitness and recreational activities, designed to enhance workouts and promote stability during exercises. It is positioned on a light gray rug on the left side of the room, specifically in the exercise area of an indoor scene. This versatile piece of fitness equipment contributes to the overall environment of the living room or open space, emphasizing its role in physical activities and routines.&lt;SEP&gt;The exercise ball is positioned on the floor in the indoor environment, indicating its use for fitness.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-e777f77f816e4ff69eb46597d7711d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbd19b552f2796429c56aa27ab89f6bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fae1e4a0a20d9a09831a9b5d49619d65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe69edc1fac589e4f6f4d1fc649968ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3766328c3cde2e0365b9ffc47d9f6bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-798eb7758d55600cec34d19901420b51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b639cd1c084b9a66144da184b9c32741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c52f295cd0cbfdbfe68b4b29e6768f84</data>
