    <node id="Couch">
      <data key="d0">Couch</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The Couch is a piece of furniture designed for seating, typically characterized by its softness and comfort. It is primarily upholstered, making it an ideal option for relaxation. As an essential seating furniture, the Couch provides both functionality and aesthetic appeal in various settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"Provides seating and comfort.";"can be sat upon;"provides_seating";used as a resting place"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"limited_by_space"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"Visible in the background of the scene."</data>
      <data key="d7">A couch is a piece of furniture designed to seat two or more people, commonly found in living room environments. It serves as a seating area that provides comfort, making it an essential element of any living space. The specific couch in question is light gray in color, situated in a location adjacent to a bicycle and behind an indoor plant. It is positioned near the wall on the far left side of the room, adding both functionality and aesthetic appeal to the living environment. Overall, this light gray upholstered couch enhances the comfort and style of the area it occupies.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-ae114f81715ddb69617d8aeb958fa539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe69edc1fac589e4f6f4d1fc649968ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ca8dbd42a1ba490605848abbde35a0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b639cd1c084b9a66144da184b9c32741&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c52f295cd0cbfdbfe68b4b29e6768f84</data>
