    <node id="Kitchen Countertop">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen Countertop</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kitchen Countertop is a flat surface commonly found in kitchens, serving multiple purposes. It is primarily utilized for food preparation, providing a designated area where various tools and items can be placed and retrieved. Additionally, it functions as a storage space for kitchen essentials, ensuring that everything needed for cooking is easily accessible. Overall, the Kitchen Countertop is an essential component of kitchen design, facilitating efficiency and organization in culinary tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"support;display";hold</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">N/A</data>
      <data key="d7">The kitchen countertop is a versatile work surface located in the kitchen. It serves as a primary working space where various kitchen tools and food items are conveniently positioned. Notably, it has been identified as the specific location where a screwdriver can be found. The kitchen countertop is designated as the new location for the screwdriver that the agent should fetch, emphasizing its importance in both functionality and organization within the kitchen environment.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-597005f2046052883060cb8d0b574098&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f518dde25f16f006065bce4c2af2e78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dab3b2ab25624ac7380dc7e69935118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1acaff11bbff5a86e31bcdd5bfb75840</data>
