      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A hand tool used for driving screws."&lt;SEP&gt;A screwdriver is a hand-held tool specifically designed for turning screws. It features a shaped tip that fits into the head of a screw, making it an essential tool in various construction, repair, and assembly tasks. This versatile tool is commonly used for both professional and DIY applications, highlighting its importance in working with screws.&lt;SEP&gt;"A small, often metal tool with a handle, used to drive screws."</data>
