      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"kitchen (countertop)"</data>
      <data key="d7">In the foreground on or near the sofa before use, the screwdriver is a hand-held tool designed for turning screws, essential in fastening materials together or removing them.&lt;SEP&gt;The Screwdriver is a hand tool used to move and drive screws; however, it was not directly observed in this task.&lt;SEP&gt;The screwdriver is a hand tool specifically designed for driving screws. Recently, its location was updated and confirmed to be on the kitchen countertop, having previously been located on the sofa and intended to be moved to a specific receptacle. Initially, it was noted that the screwdriver's location had changed from the right counter to the kitchen countertop, indicating a recent shift in its placement for easier access.</data>
